---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { CONTACT_EMAIL } from "../lib/site";
---

<Base
  title="Privacy"
  description="What the MCP Linker website, purchases, and desktop app do with your data."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">Privacy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">Last updated: October 13, 2026</p>

    <section class="mt-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">This website</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-muted">
        The site is static. It has no accounts, no cookies, and no analytics.
        Our hosting provider may keep standard request logs, such as IP address
        and user agent. Server icons are loaded from cdn.jsdelivr.net.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Purchases</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-muted">
        Purchases are handled by Polar, the merchant of record. Polar collects
        your email and payment details under its <a
          href="https://polar.sh/legal/privacy"
          class="text-brand hover:underline">privacy policy</a
        >. We receive order details (email, product, amount) so we can support
        customers and issue keys.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">The desktop app</h2>
      <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-muted">
        <li>Your server configurations stay on your computer.</li>
        <li>
          Discover fetches servers from the official MCP Registry, and the
          catalog and icons from GitHub and jsDelivr.
        </li>
        <li>
          Activating a license sends your license key and a random device ID to
          Polar. The ID is generated by the app and is not derived from your
          computer's name or hardware. Deactivating sends the key again to free
          the device. Nothing is checked after activation.
        </li>
        <li>The auto-updater checks GitHub Releases.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Contact</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-muted">
        Questions or requests: <a
          href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}
          class="text-brand hover:underline">{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a
        >.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
